<!--
  Every indexable page, once, at its canonical URL.

  No <lastmod>, <changefreq> or <priority>. Google ignores the last two, and a
  <lastmod> that is not maintained is worse than absent — it teaches crawlers
  that the dates here are noise. If this ever needs date hints, generate them
  from git rather than typing them.

  404.html is deliberately absent: it carries `robots: noindex`, and listing a
  page you have asked not to be indexed is a contradiction crawlers report.

  `check.py` fails if a page exists that is not listed here, so this cannot
  quietly fall behind the site.
-->
